  m_Name: bell_in_the_fog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PrincesPalace.Core::PrincesPalace.Content.EventDefinition
  data:
    Id: bell_in_the_fog
    SortOrder: 2
    Floors: 
    Requires:
    - Kind: 0
      CharacterId: sheep
      CharacterDisplayName: Shawn
      Ability: 0
      Min: 0
      HasMin: 0
      Max: 0
      HasMax: 0
      CounterId: 
      RequireStanding: 1
      AuthoredReason: 
    Pages:
    - Id: bell
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/stump_bell.png
      Title: The Bell in the Fog
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Touch the bell
        Requires:
        - Kind: 0
          CharacterId: sheep
          CharacterDisplayName: Shawn
          Ability: 0
          Min: 0
          HasMin: 0
          Max: 0
          HasMax: 0
          CounterId: 
          RequireStanding: 1
          AuthoredReason: 
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 9
            Amount: 0
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
            FightId: bellwether
            ShelfId: 
            Reveal: 0
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 0
      - Text: Ask the others
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: bear
            CharacterDisplayName: Bjorn
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: owl
            CharacterDisplayName: Odette
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: ask_both
          IsLeave: 0
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: bear
            CharacterDisplayName: Bjorn
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: ask_bjorn
          IsLeave: 0
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: owl
            CharacterDisplayName: Odette
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: ask_odette
          IsLeave: 0
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: ask_none
          IsLeave: 0
      - Text: Walk away
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: Shawn keeps looking back until the fog closes over the clearing.
            Nothing follows. The bell is patient.
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: The fog thickens until the trees are only shapes. Then a clearing the
          path never promised, and in it an old stump. On the stump, a bell.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Polished brass, not a fingerprint on it, hung from a new leather strap.
          Everything else in this forest is moss and rot. The bell is clean.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: Do you hear it? It's ringing. Nobody's touching it, and it's ringing.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: It makes no sound. The mist around it does not stir. Shawn has taken
          a step toward the stump, and does not seem to know it.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: I think I'm meant to touch it. I don't know how I know that.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Past the trees, soft as breath, something is counting. It has lost
          its place before, and started again.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
    - Id: ask_both
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/stump_bell.png
      Title: The Bell in the Fog
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Listen again
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: bell
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      - CharacterId: bear
        Side: 1
      - CharacterId: owl
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: You hear it. Tell me you hear it.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
      - SpeakerId: bear
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: Hear what, little one? It's a bell on a stump. It isn't doing a thing.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: neutral
      - SpeakerId: owl
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: There is no sound at all. No birds, either. I noticed the birds first.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: neutral
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Shawn looks from one to the other as if they were speaking to him through
          water.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: It's so loud.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
    - Id: ask_bjorn
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/stump_bell.png
      Title: The Bell in the Fog
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Listen again
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: bell
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      - CharacterId: bear
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: Bjorn. You hear it, don't you?
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
      - SpeakerId: bear
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 0
        Side: 1
        Text: I hear wind, and you breathing hard. That's all. Say the word and we
          walk on.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: neutral
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: It's so loud.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
    - Id: ask_odette
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/stump_bell.png
      Title: The Bell in the Fog
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Listen again
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: bell
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      - CharacterId: owl
        Side: 1
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: Odette. You hear it, don't you?
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
      - SpeakerId: owl
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 3
        Side: 1
        Text: I hear nothing, Shawn. That is what worries me. Even the fog has gone
          quiet.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: nervous
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: It's so loud.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
    - Id: ask_none
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/stump_bell.png
      Title: The Bell in the Fog
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Listen again
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: bell
          IsLeave: 0
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: There is no one standing to ask. The fog keeps its own counsel.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: Just me, then. Just me and the bell.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
    - Id: endure
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/endure.png
      Title: The Flock
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Leave
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: bear
            CharacterDisplayName: Bjorn
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: owl
            CharacterDisplayName: Odette
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects: []
          Result: '"Gone?" Bjorn frowns. "You touched it and let go." Odette nods:
            a second, no more. Neither of them hears the flock still walking behind
            the trees.'
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: bear
            CharacterDisplayName: Bjorn
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects: []
          Result: '"Gone?" Bjorn frowns. "You touched it and let go. A second, no
            more." He does not hear the flock still walking behind the trees.'
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
        - Requires:
          - Kind: 0
            CharacterId: owl
            CharacterDisplayName: Odette
            Ability: 0
            Min: 0
            HasMin: 0
            Max: 0
            HasMax: 0
            CounterId: 
            RequireStanding: 1
            AuthoredReason: 
          Effects: []
          Result: Odette tilts her head. "A second, Shawn. You touched it and let
            go." She does not hear the flock still walking behind the trees.
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: No one is standing to tell him. The fog does not say. Behind the
            trees, soft as breath, the flock is still walking.
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: On the tenth toll the Bellwether stops, and the flock stops behind
          it. Then, all together, they turn to look at him.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Every sheep in the flock is wearing his face. Not a face like his.
          His. Hundreds of him, patient in the fog, waiting to be counted.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 6
        Side: 0
        Text: ...Oh.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: entranced
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: The bell rings once more, very close, and Shawn opens his eyes. He
          is standing at the stump. His hoof has only just left the brass.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 3
        Side: 0
        Text: How long was I gone?
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: nervous
    - Id: break
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/bell_broken.png
      Title: The Broken Bell
      Body: 
      Choices:
      - Text: Leave
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects: []
          Result: 
          GoTo: 
          IsLeave: 1
      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
      Cast:
      - CharacterId: sheep
        Side: 0
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: The Bellwether folds into the fog without a sound, and the flock behind
          it goes too, like breath off glass.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Shawn is standing at the stump, hoof on the brass. Under it the bell
          cracks, one clean line from crown to lip. The tolling stops.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: sheep
        IsNarration: 0
        Expression: 3
        Side: 0
        Text: I didn't mean to. I only wanted it to stop.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: nervous
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: The strap is still new. He takes the bell anyway. It is warm, as if
          someone had been holding it for a very long time.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Behind the trees, whatever was counting loses its place, and does not
          start again.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
    BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/bell_in_the_fog/fog_clearing.png
    MayReturn: 1
    Speakers: []
    Fights:
