          CounterId: 
          CharacterId: 
          CharacterDisplayName: 
          RelicId: 
          RelicDisplayName: 
          FightId: 
          ShelfId: 
          Reveal: 0
        Result: Shawn wakes on the wet ground with the taste of brass in his mouth.
          The stump is empty. No bell, no strap, no mark where either hung.
        GoTo: 
        IsLeave: 1
      HasOnSurvived: 1
      HasOnFell: 1
    Shelves: []
